        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Chiltern Shakespeare Company\n- Products: Twelfth Night, She's the Man, Just One of the Guys\n- People: William Shakespeare\n- Concepts: Shakespearean comedy, remakes, stage productions\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare wrote the comedy \"Twelfth Night, or What You Will\" around 1601–02 as a Twelfth Night entertainment for the close of the Christmas season.\n- The film \"She's the Man\" was inspired by William Shakespeare's play \"Twelfth Night\".\n- The film \"She's the Man\" is a remake of the 1985 film \"Just One of the Guys\".\n- The Chiltern Shakespeare Company has recently produced \"Much Ado about Nothing\", \"Twelfth Night\", \"A Midsummer Night's Dream\", \"As You Like It\", \"The Taming of the Shrew\", \"The Merchant of Venice\", and \"The Merry Wives of Windsor\".",
